   "detailed_description": "<h1>EDITIONS BREAKDOWN</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/b2be5bd5fdf07529f79dc19219bd70ab.avif?t=1790874369\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f1870f76f228ea18e47d342dd96b9113.poster.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f1870f76f228ea18e47d342dd96b9113.webm?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/82e2cf74134f2150f5d17ddf1b9fe6ce.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">展現超凡技能和蠻橫武力，成為星際戰士。憑藉致命能力和毀滅性武器，消滅頑強的泰倫蟲群。在這款第三人稱動作遊戲中單兵上陣，或是加入多人模式聯手抗敵，捍衛人類帝國。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/23fc044dc2f76c49de8cfb86439f608b.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/ca8f7a4a27030ad6daf47aef22f9b075.poster.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/ca8f7a4a27030ad6daf47aef22f9b075.webm?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">本遊戲為 2011 年《星際戰士》的正統續作，在本作中，您將扮演德梅特里安·泰圖斯副官重返極限戰士戰團，對抗人類帝國的敵人，再次證明您的赤膽忠心。以遙不可及的星球作為舞台，親征壯闊戰役，守護星系不受恐懼侵襲，揭發不可告人的晦暗黑幕。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/1d6b556411148c40d49c40364d0445ba.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/00235ebe7022261023c1166460b5937a.poster.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/00235ebe7022261023c1166460b5937a.webm?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">以第三人稱視點享受血脈賁張、節奏爽快的動作場面，在橫跨星系的壯闊戰役中面對洪水般的蟲潮！本作得益於 Saber 著名的 Swarm Engine™ 技術，讓數以百計的敵人沖刷您的螢幕畫面，血屠蜂擁來襲的泰倫蟲群！  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/658e83b1fe7ff8589e17e97dc31e3c29.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=104 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">投身可無限重玩的 PvE 和 PvP 遊戲模式，化身您心目中的星際戰士執行嗜血殘暴的任務；隨著遊玩次數增加，還能解鎖新技能和造型外觀！本作含七種特化職業可供選擇，每種職業可解鎖多達 25 項專精，為每把武器加裝特殊機能，還能用各式各樣的裝甲和武器塗裝，為裝備增添獨特魅力！  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/a7eb29dc14385a0cbe5ac59801ec24cc.avif?t=1790874369\" width=780 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/6c734f5d5b47652093aaa170b97da370.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f5ec2b6f71789b7aae7a252f19ac439d.poster.avif?t=1790874369\" width=610 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f5ec2b6f71789b7aae7a252f19ac439d.webm?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f5ec2b6f71789b7aae7a252f19ac439d.mp4?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">三人聯手，在嚴酷的圍攻模式中浴血奮戰，力抗接踵而至的泰倫蟲族與混沌攻勢。每波殲敵皆可累積點數，用於換取彈藥、裝備、藥用激勵劑，更能召喚卡迪亞軍、星際戰士與無畏機兵前來助陣。</p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f1870f76f228ea18e47d342dd96b9113.poster.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f1870f76f228ea18e47d342dd96b9113.webm?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/82e2cf74134f2150f5d17ddf1b9fe6ce.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">展現超凡技能和蠻橫武力，成為星際戰士。憑藉致命能力和毀滅性武器，消滅頑強的泰倫蟲群。在這款第三人稱動作遊戲中單兵上陣，或是加入多人模式聯手抗敵，捍衛人類帝國。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/23fc044dc2f76c49de8cfb86439f608b.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=104 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/ca8f7a4a27030ad6daf47aef22f9b075.poster.avif?t=1790874369\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/ca8f7a4a27030ad6daf47aef22f9b075.webm?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">本遊戲為 2011 年《星際戰士》的正統續作，在本作中，您將扮演德梅特里安·泰圖斯副官重返極限戰士戰團，對抗人類帝國的敵人，再次證明您的赤膽忠心。以遙不可及的星球作為舞台，親征壯闊戰役，守護星系不受恐懼侵襲，揭發不可告人的晦暗黑幕。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https