"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f5ec2b6f71789b7aae7a252f19ac439d.poster.avif?t=1790874369\" width=610 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f5ec2b6f71789b7aae7a252f19ac439d.webm?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183900/extras/f5ec2b6f71789b7aae7a252f19ac439d.mp4?t=1790874369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">三人聯手，在嚴酷的圍攻模式中浴血奮戰，力抗接踵而至的泰倫蟲族與混沌攻勢。每波殲敵皆可累積點數，用於換取彈藥、裝備、藥用激勵劑，更能召喚卡迪亞軍、星際戰士與無畏機兵前來助陣。</p>",
